{"id":"2d3d18f0211ece52","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-normal-replacement.md","title":"Replacement of Provable Equivalents","display":"lem-normal-replacement — Replacement of Provable Equivalents","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-normal-replacement","aliases":["89-lem-normal-replacement"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-normal-replacement — Replacement of Provable Equivalents","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-substitution-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-normal-replacement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-normal-replacement</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-normal-replacement — Replacement of Provable Equivalents"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[p:=B]\">\\(F[p:=B]\\)</span> 是结构代入；模态命题语言没有绑定变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in L\\Longrightarrow\n(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C])\\in L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in L\\Longrightarrow\n(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C])\\in L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 7；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 结构归纳。底与不被替换的字母给重言式，字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 给假设；否定、合取由经典命题逻辑。盒情形先必然化归纳所得的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 定理，再用 K 的两个方向得到盒等价。此定理的前提是全局可证等价，不能把某世界中真等价直接当成这个前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"F[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in L\\Longrightarrow\n(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C])\\in L.","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1151,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","48f7a8aeae4eecb4"]}